                    "frequency": "Middle",
                    "semantic_group_id": "gambler_figurative",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "As an investor, she was a natural <w>gambler</w> willing to put money into risky startups.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "ru": "Как инвестор, она была прирождённым <w>игроком</w>, готовым вкладывать деньги в рискованные стартапы."
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "The young entrepreneur was a reckless <w>gambler</w> who ignored cautious advice.",
